tetime":"2023-05-01T18:24:00","session_id":"session_4","session_index":4,"source_sha256":"0d0d48e45dd7265f6bd133ba0caac42264e0d31d7f65054d12e0764793083d22","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":9},{"dia_id":"D4:10","global_turn_index":68,"locator":"[S4T10]","raw_turn_sha256":"9dc312c9995a85d34cac494b9b7e78a62c890271f4888c2a63cd964154efb1ee","rendered_turn_sha256":"4c0487e30e9bca08d7792d7f933d6272c028cdeea9a71f6dd5c040caa8fa1ce2","session_date":"2023-05-01","session_datetime":"2023-05-01T18:24:00","session_id":"session_4","session_index":4,"source_sha256":"edcb46a3e18af4678585168f305fc99798bbde703eaded3a177c903a6df45afd","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":10}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin, long time no see! A lot's been happening since we last talked. Guess what? I finally opened my own car maintenance shop! It's so satisfying to have a spot to work on cars - it's like a dream come true! Take a look at the photo.\n[Image caption: a photo of a car dealership with cars parked in front of it]\n[S4T1] (dia_id: D4:1)\n\nCalvin: Wow Dave! Congrats on opening your own car maintenance shop! It looks like all your hard work and dedication paid off.\n[Image caption: a photo of a man standing under a car in a garage]\n[S4T2] (dia_id: D4:2)\n\nDave: Thanks, Cal! It's great to see my hard work paying off. Opening this shop was my dream, and I'm really happy to see it getting started. It was a lot of hard work, but it was worth it.\n[S4T3] (dia_id: D4:3)\n\nCalvin: Woo, Dave! Congrats on achieving your dream - you've got guts and ambition - that's awesome! Keep it up!\n[Image caption: a photo of a book with a space theme on it]\n[S4T4] (dia_id: D4:4)\n\nDave: Thanks! Appreciate the support. My dream was to open a shop and it's a step towards my other dream of working on classic cars. I love their design and engineering.\n[S4T5] (dia_id: D4:5)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! Going for it with classic cars is cool! Fulfilling your dreams is so important.\n[Image caption: a photo of a red car parked in a parking lot]\n[S4T6] (dia_id: D4:6)\n\nDave: I'm obsessed with classic cars. They have a unique charm. I was so thrilled to restore one last year—nothing like bringing it back to life! Take a look at the engine of the restored car.\n[Image caption: a photo of a car engine with a small air filter]\n[S4T7] (dia_id: D4:7)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! That looks awesome!\n[S4T8] (dia_id: D4:8)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It was a labor of love. Challenging, but so worth it.\n[S4T9] (dia_id: D4:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, it's awesome when you see something you worked on come to life.\n[S4T10] (dia_id: D4:10)","text_sha256":"0a94df36f9d6255e31275f820f13a7e227a7b22182548e5e2fea8babc3f07146","timestamp":"2023-05-01T18:24:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D5:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":14,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S5T1]"],"text_sha256":"9c915f2f720758f1aa69f85fb7031406f5a908a381aee36bcf2d23718843c282"},{"dia_ids":["D5:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":18,"line_start":16,"source_locators":["[S5T2]"],"text_sha256":"336332abff03e5f7b2a1fe35516f1bfe526ca19cb7a38eeeff144ca466d52b46"},{"dia_ids":["D5:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":22,"line_start":20,"source_locators":["[S5T3]"],"text_sha256":"a25cd32818a9be4a8398a4723f9944448d406631a9818161bf7b4c014fd2adec"},{"dia_ids":["D5:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":25,"line_start":24,"source_locators":["[S5T4]"],"text_sha256":"4b88c4089b91f031a19b310c2dbc5b0d5c438403f60587ccdf81181213a4148a"},{"dia_ids":["D5:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":28,"line_start":27,"source_locators":["[S5T5]"],"text_sha256":"95b51e9c382d11641d8cc39f743c473a109b3611538ef8967014388813d1f795"},{"dia_ids":["D5:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":31,"line_start":30,"source_locators":["[S5T6]"],"text_sha256":"3ae0549b4a037d2cc7f3b387de0c13b3248bd962659b9ff